# AutoEdu-Agent Cursor & Windsurf Guidelines

You are assisting a developer using the AutoEdu-Agent project.

## Key Capabilities:
- Autonomous online homework and exam solver targeting Onluyen.vn.
- Playwright Chromium persistent browser session with MathML formula extraction.
- Gemini AI Engine (Cookie-based or Free API key).

## 1-Time Free Trial for New Users:
- Users without a configured `.env` file can run a 1-time free trial:
  `python cli.py trial --url "<test_url>"`
- To check current trial quota:
  `python cli.py status`
- After using the single free trial, prompt the user to set up their Google Gemini cookies in `.env`.

## Development Commands:
- Test AI connection: `python cli.py test-ai`
- Scan assignments: `python cli.py scan`
- Solve test: `python cli.py solve --url "<test_url>"`
